eries/\" target=\"_self\">To learn about the funds included in the Hedged Equity Fund Series.</a></p>\n","alertMoreInfo":""}},"US46645V3454":{"alertNoticeMessage":{"alertTitle":"","alertContent":"<p><a title=\"To learn about the funds included in the Hedged Equity Fund Series\" aria-label=\"To learn about the funds included in the Hedged Equity Fund Series\" href=\"https://am.jpmorgan.com/us/en/asset-management/adv/funds/hedged-equity-fund-series/\" target=\"_self\">To learn about the funds included in the Hedged Equity Fund Series.</a></p>\n","alertMoreInfo":""}},"4812A4815":{"alertNoticeMessage":{"alertTitle":"","alertContent":"The JPMorgan High Yield Municipal Fund is currently expected to be reorganized into an exchange-traded fund as of the close of business on July 14, 2023. Investors are urged to read the <a href=\"https://am.jpmorgan.com/content/dam/jpm-am-aem/americas/us/en/supplemental/fund-announcement/jpmorgan-high-yield-municipal-etf.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Information Statement/Prospectus</a> because it contains important information about the reorganization.","alertMoreInfo":""}},"46641Q654":{"alertCustomMessage":{"alertTitle":"NOTE","alertContent":"<p>JPMorgan Ultra-Short Municipal Income ETF (JMST) has a similar investment strategy to&nbsp;<a href=\"https://am.jpmorgan.com/us/en/asset-management/adv/products/jpmorgan-ultra-short-municipal-fund-i-46641u481\" target=\"_self\">JPMorgan Ultra-Short Municipal Fund</a>. Despite any similarities, these funds have important differences that investors should consider carefully before investing. To understand these differences and decide which fund is best suited for you, review the prospectuses and consult your investment professional.</p>\n","alertMoreInfo":""}},"US46641U4812":{"alertCustomMessage":{"alertTitle":"NOTE","alertContent":"<p>JPMorgan Ultra-Short Municipal Fund has a similar investment strategy to<a href=\"https://am.jpmorgan.com/us/en/asset-management/adv/products/jpmorgan-ultra-short-municipal-income-etf-etf-shares-46641q654\" target=\"_self\">&nbsp;JPMorgan Ultra-Short Municipal Income ETF</a>&nbsp;(JMST). Despite any similarities, these funds have important differences that investors should consider carefully before investing. To understand these differences and decide which fund is best suited for you, review the prospectuses and consult your investment professional.</p>\n","alertMoreInfo":""}},"US46654Q8078":{"alertNoticeMessage":{"alertTitle":"","alertContent":"<p><b>Important Notice Regarding the Fund’s Diversification Policy:</b>&nbsp;The Fund is classified as “diversified” under the Investment Company Act of 1940 (1940 Act). However, the Fund may operate as a “non-diversified” fund, as defined by the 1940 Act, to the approximate extent the Morningstar Emerging Markets Target Market Exposure Index (the “Index”) is non-diversified solely as a result of a change in relative market capitalization or index weighting of one or more constituents of the Index.</p>\n","alertMoreInfo":""}},"46641Q142":{"alertNoticeMessage":{"alertTitle":"","alertContent":"<p>The Board of Trustees of the JPMorgan Climate Change Solutions ETF (TEMP) has approved the liquidation and dissolution of the Fund on or about October 3, 2025. Effective immediately, in connection with the liquidation and dissolution, the Fund may depart from its stated investment objective and strategies as it increases its cash holdings in preparation for its liquidation.</p>\n","alertMoreInfo":""}},"340332B4A0686344E0630100007F1406":{"alertNoticeMessage":{"alertTitle":"","alertContent":"<p><a href=\"https://jpmorgan.55-ip.com/\">Click here to register on 55ip to access customization and tax-smart technology capabilities for this strategy.</a></p>\n","alertMoreInfo":""}},"US46641Q2259":{"alertCustomMessage":{"alertTitle":"NOTE","alertContent":"<p><b>Important Notice Regarding the Fund’s Diversification Policy:</b>&nbsp;The Fund is classified as “diversified” under the Investment Company Act of 1940 (1940 Act). However, the Fund may operate as a “non-diversified” fund, as defined by the 1940 Act, to the approximate extent the Morningstar Canada Target Market Exposure Index (the “Index”) is non-diversified solely as a result of a change in relative market capitalization or index weighting of one or more constituents of the Index.</p>\n","alertMoreInfo":""}},"US48123X8359":{"alertCustomMessage":{"alertTitle":"NOTE","alertContent":"<p>JPMorgan 100% U.S. Treasury Securities Money Market Fund has a similar investment strategy to&nbsp;<a href=\"https://am.jpmorgan.com/us/en/asset-management/adv/products/jpmorgan-100-u-s-treasury-securities-money-market-etf-etf-shares-46654q542\">JPMorgan 100% U.S. Treasury Securities Money Market ETF (JMMF)</a>. Despite any similarities, these funds have important differences that investors should consider carefully before investing. To understand these differences and decide which fund is best suited for you, review the prospectuses and consult your investment professional.</p>\n","alertMoreInfo":""}},"US48129C884":{"alertNoticeMessage":{"alertTitle":"","alertContent":"The JPMorgan Equity Focus Fund is currently expected to be reorganized into an exchange-traded fund as of the close of business on July 28, 2023.  Investors are urged to read the Information <a href=\"https://am.jpmorgan.com/content/dam/jpm-am-aem/americas/us/en/supplemental/fund-announcement/jpmorgan-equity-focus-etf.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Statement/Prospectus</a>  because it contains important information about the reorganization.","alertMoreInfo":""}},"US4812C22134":{"alertCustomMessage":{"alertTitle":"NOTE","alertContent":"<p><b>Important Notice Regarding the Fund’s Diversification Policy:</b>&nbsp;The Fund is classified as “diversified” under the Investment Company Act of 1940 (1940 Act). However, the Fund may operate as a “non-diversified” fund, as defined by the 1940 Act, to the approximate extent the S&amp;P 500 Index (the “Index”) is non-diversified solely as a result of a change in relative market capitalization or index weighting of one or more constituents of the Index.</p>\n","alertMoreInfo":""}},"4812C1520":{"alertCustomMessage":{"alertTitle":"NOTE","alertContent":"<p><b>Important Notice Regarding the Fund’s Diversification Policy:</b>&nbsp;The Fund is classified as “diversified” under the Investment Company Act of 1940 (1940 Act). However, the Fund may operate as a “non-diversified” fund, as defined by the 1940 Act, to the approximate extent the S&amp;P 500 Index (the “Index”) is non-diversified solely as a result of a change in relative market capitalization or index weighting of one or more constituents of the Index.</p>\n","alertMoreInfo":""}},"4812C2213":{"alertCustomMessage":{"alertTitle":"NOTE","alertContent":"<p><b>Important Notice Regarding the Fund’s Diversification Policy:</b>&nbsp;The Fund is classified as “diversified” under the Investment Company Act of 1940 (1940 Act). However, the Fund may operate as a “non-diversified” fund, as defined by the 1940 Act, to the approximate extent the S&amp;P 500 Index (the “Index”) is non-diversified solely as a result of a change in relative market capitalization or index weighting of one or more constituents of the Index.</p>\n","alertMoreInfo":""}},"48123X835":{"alertCustomMessage":{"alertTitle":"NOTE","alertContent":"<p>JPMorgan 100% U.S. Treasury Securities Money Market Fund has a similar investment strategy to&nbsp;<a href=\"https://am.jpmorgan.com/us/en/asset-management/adv/products/jpmorgan-100-u-s-treasury-securities-money-market-etf-etf-shares-46654q542\">JPMorgan 100% U.S. Treasury Securities Money Market ETF (JMMF)</a>. Despite any similarities, these funds have important differences that investors should consider carefully before investing. To understand these differences and decide which fund is best suited for you, review the prospectuses and consult your investment professional.</p>\n","alertMoreInfo":""}},"46645V378":{"alertNoticeMessage":{"alertTitl