ent Company Act of 1940 (1940 Act). However, the Fund may operate as a “non-diversified” fund, as defined by the 1940 Act, to the approximate extent the Morningstar US Target Market Exposure Index (the “Index”) is non-diversified solely as a result of a change in relative market capitalization or index weighting of one or more constituents of the Index.</p>\n","alertMoreInfo":""}},"4812C0837":{"alertCustomMessage":{"alertTitle":"NOTE","alertContent":"<p>JPMorgan Core Plus Bond Fund has a similar investment strategy to&nbsp;<a href=\"https://am.jpmorgan.com/us/en/asset-management/adv/products/jpmorgan-core-plus-bond-etf-etf-shares-46641q670\" target=\"_self\">JPMorgan Core Plus Bond ETF (JCPB)</a>&nbsp;Despite any similarities, these funds have important differences that investors should consider carefully before investing. To understand these differences and decide which fund is best suited for you, review the prospectuses and consult your investment professional.&nbsp;</p>\n","alertMoreInfo":""}},"46645V659":{"alertCustomMessage":{"alertTitle":"NOTE","alertContent":"<p>JPMorgan Equity Premium Income Fund has a similar investment strategy to&nbsp;<a href=\"https://am.jpmorgan.com/us/en/asset-management/adv/products/jpmorgan-equity-premium-income-etf-etf-shares-46641q332\" target=\"_self\">JPMorgan Equity Premium Income ETF (JEPI).</a>&nbsp;Despite any similarities, these funds have important differences that investors should consider carefully before investing. To understand these differences and decide which fund is best suited for you, review the prospectuses and consult your investment professional.</p>\n","alertMoreInfo":""}},"46654Q542":{"alertCustomMessage":{"alertTitle":"NOTE","alertContent":"<p>JPMorgan 100% U.S. Treasury Securities Money Market ETF (JMMF) has a similar investment strategy to&nbsp;<a href=\"https://am.jpmorgan.com/us/en/asset-management/protected/adv/products/jpmorgan-100-u-s-treasury-securities-money-market-fund-capital-4812a0375\">JPMorgan 100% U.S. Treasury Securities Money Market Fund</a>. Despite any similarities, these funds have important differences that investors should consider carefully before investing. To understand these differences and decide which fund is best suited for you, review the prospectuses and consult your investment professional.</p>\n","alertMoreInfo":""},"alertDisclosure":{"alertTitle":"","alertContent":"<p><b>IMPORTANT DISCLOSURES: You could lose money by investing in the Fund. Because the share price of the Fund will fluctuate, when you sell your shares, they may be worth more or less than what you originally paid for them.</b></p>\n<p><b>An investment in the Fund is not insured or guaranteed by the Federal Deposit Insurance Corporation or any other government agency. The Fund’s sponsor has no legal obligation to provide financial support to the Fund, and you should not expect that the sponsor will provide financial support to the Fund at any time.</b></p>\n<p><b>Any gain resulting from the sale or exchange of Fund shares will be taxable as long-term or short-term gain, depending upon how long you have held your shares.</b></p>\n","alertMoreInfo":""}},"C0A4F24170B810F5E0534E8862A96D74":{"alertNoticeMessage":{"alertTitle":"","alertContent":"<p>A similar strategy is available with customization and enhanced tax management capabilities through the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://am.jpmorgan.com/us/en/asset-management/protected/adv/products/jpmorgan-tax-smart-u-s-technology-leaders-strategy-410fc94e66384b0ce0630100007fa551\" target=\"_self\">JPMorgan Tax-Smart U.S. Technology Leaders Strategy</a>. Despite similarities, these strategies have important differences that should be considered before investing.</p>\n","alertMoreInfo":""}}};
